Zulip API shapes for tests/test_zulip_frontend.py.

event_*.json are single entries of the `events` list that GET
/api/v1/events returns; api_*.json are whole responses of the REST calls.
Field sets follow the Zulip API documentation pages get-events,
get-messages, send-message, add-reaction, register-queue, get-stream-id,
update-message, get-streams and upload-file. Ids: bot 50, owner 9, a
colleague 12, another bot 51; stream `ea` is 7, `ea-dm` is 8.
